{"ref":"BDB Aramaic, יַצִּיב","hw":"יַצִּיב","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">יַצִּיב</span></big>  <strong>adj. certain, true (</strong>𝔗 id., <em>firm, native</em> (= <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶזְרָח</span>)<strong>)</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:8\" href=\"/Daniel.2.8\">Dn 2:8</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:45\" href=\"/Daniel.2.45\">45</a>, emph. -<span dir=\"rtl\">בָא</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 3:24\" href=\"/Daniel.3.24\">3:24</a> (K<sup>§ 59. g</sup>); fs. -<span dir=\"rtl\">בָא</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 6:13\" href=\"/Daniel.6.13\">6:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:16\" href=\"/Daniel.7.16\">7:16</a>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>certain, sure</em> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:45\" href=\"/Daniel.2.45\">Dn 2:45</a>; in exclam. <a data-ref=\"Daniel 3:24\" href=\"/Daniel.3.24\">3:24</a> <em>undoubtedly!</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">מִן־יַצִּיב</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:8\" href=\"/Daniel.2.8\">2:8</a> <em>of a surety</em>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>true</em> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 6:13\" href=\"/Daniel.6.13\">6:13</a>; f. as subst. <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:16\" href=\"/Daniel.7.16\">7:16</a> <em>the truth</em> concerning, <span dir=\"rtl\">עַל</span> rei.","next":"BDB Aramaic, יְקַד","prev":"BDB Aramaic, יְצַב"}